        "created_at": "2012-03-15T18:28:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay, I just got Rook City and was looking at Plague Rat’s deck.  He has 5 infection cards, tons of ways to get them into play, but no way to get them from the discard?</p>\n<p>Am I missing something?  Or does the search his deck for infection cards include a way to get them back from the discard pile?</p>\n<p>Or is he really tough even without the infections?  They’re just an added bonus?</p>",
